WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.500
Why are you so sad?

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.000
It's that I wanted to vote for a mayor

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
who would truly make Santarém better.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.500
On one side, there's the one

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:09.500
with no experience to run the city,

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:11.500
who doesn't know how to bring real change.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:14.000
On the other side, there's the one

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.000
who wants to keep things the way they are,

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.000
benefiting the same old crowd.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.500
He won't make anything better for the people.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:22.500
But there's also Jardel 77.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.000
There's Jardel 77.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Jardel? What about Jardel?

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.000
There's Jardel, running for mayor. He's 77.
